Line 1: All the values of a map have to be the same kind: the first is an amount in dollars, but this is an amount in euros.
    save a bar chart of a map of "rent" to $1,200 and "hotel" to €300 as "trip.svg".
                                                                 ^^^^

Line 2: All the items of a list have to be the same kind: the first is an amount in pounds, but this is an amount in dollars.
    save a pie chart of a list of £5 and $3 as "mixed.svg".
                                         ^^
